he correct shape is there, but you did not place the outer two blocks for the rear wall.\n\nLook at the base of the house. There are five blocks. They look like this:\n```\n[B][B][B][B][B]\n```\n\nThe wall at the front looks like this:\n```\n  [B]\n[B][B][B][B][B]\n```\nWhere [B] denotes a block, and the position of the center block is (0, 1, -2).\n\nThe rear wall also needs the outermost blocks to be present as well. Try placing 2 more blocks on top of the first and fifth foundation blocks from the left. So the blocks should be at (-2, 1, -3), and (2, 1, -3).\n\nPlease confirm once you have placed the blocks.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': '```json\n{\n    "communication":"Placing final 2 blocks in the rear wall",\n    "actions": {\n        "place_block": [\n            ["blue", -2, 1, -3],\n            ["blue", 2, 1, -3]\n        ]\n    }\n}\n```'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'World Feedback: The world is currently empty.'}], 'model': 'mistralai/Mistral-Small-3.1-24B-Instruct-2503'}}
